  <p>1. adam o nuh o payamber hon ya hazrat musa,<br> younis o khizr hon illiyas k hazrat esa,<br> ghir k mushkil me yehi..(2)<br> kehta tha hr ek nabi<br> mera waris hai ali..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Qabr me mujhse nakeerain ne jb ye pocha,<br> kon waris hai tera kon hai mola tera,<br> mujhse pehle ye meri..(2)<br> qabr ki mati boli<br> mera waris hai ali..(4)</p> 
