  <p>8. Mujhko mola mere alfaz se pehchanenge,<br> meer ko lehja o awaaz se pehchane ge,<br> roz e mehshar jo sada..(2)<br> gunjegi akbar apni<br> mera waris hai ali..(4)</p> 
